
📌 Assignment 03 - QR Decomposition for Image Classification
🧠 Problem Description

In this assignment, we implemented an image classification system using the QR decomposition method.
The dataset is a simplified version of MNIST (TinyMNIST) containing handwritten digits from 0 to 9.

Each image is a grayscale 28×28 matrix.

⚙️ Method Overview

The classification process is based on the following steps:

1. Data Preparation
Images are loaded from folders (one folder per digit class)
Each image is flattened into a 784-dimensional vector
2. Matrix Construction

For each class k∈{0,...,9}:

A matrix A
